      "id": 1794640585951.9148,
      "question": "<div style='max-width:560px;color:currentColor;'><svg viewBox='0 0 560 480' width='100%' style='display:block;max-width:520px;overflow:visible;'><polygon points='120,400 440,400 270,120' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2.6' stroke-linejoin='round'/><line x1='270' y1='120' x2='270' y2='400' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='8,6'/><path d='M270,378 L292,378 L292,400' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8'/><text x='280' y='446' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='24' font-weight='700' fill='currentColor'>8</text><text x='300' y='268' text-anchor='start' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='24' font-weight='700' fill='currentColor'>7</text><text x='110' y='426' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='20' fill='currentColor'>A</text><text x='450' y='426' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='20' fill='currentColor'>B</text><text x='270' y='106' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='20' fill='currentColor'>C</text></svg></div><br>Find the area of this triangle.",
      "options": [
        "28 square units",
        "56 square units",
        "15 square units",
        "24 square units"
      ],
      "correctAnswer": 0,
      "explanation": "The area of a triangle is A = <span style='display:inline-block;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;'><span style='display:block;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;padding:0 .35em;'>1</span><span style='display:block;padding:0 .35em;'>2</span></span> × base × height.<br><br>Here the base is 8 units and the perpendicular height is 7 units (shown by the broken line), so A = <span style='display:inline-block;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;'><span style='display:block;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;padding:0 .35em;'>1</span><span style='display:block;padding:0 .35em;'>2</span></span> × 8 × 7 = <b>28 square units</b>.<br><br>• Option B (56) comes from forgetting the factor of <span style='display:inline-block;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;'><span style='display:block;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;padding:0 .35em;'>1</span><span style='display:block;padding:0 .35em;'>2</span></span> and simply multiplying 8 × 7.<br>• Option C (15) comes from adding the base and the height instead of multiplying.<br>• Option D (24) does not follow from the given dimensions at all.",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "points": 1
    },
